Do i think users will find this useful?
Yes. I believe users will find this application useful because it provides a simple way to record and manage daily expenses.
Users can quickly search for expenses, update incorrect entries, remove unnecessary records, and view how much they have
spent overall or in each category. These features help users better understand and control their spending habits.

What features have i missed?
Due to the limited scope of this project, I did not include advanced features such as permanent file storage, user login,
budgeting tools, or charts to visualize expenses. These features would improve the application, but the current version
focuses on providing the core functions required for a simple and effective expense tracker.

What would i do to improve this?
If I had more time, I would improve the application by adding file storage so expenses are saved permanently,
